   "title": "Price movers, week of October 14",
   "html": "<p>The biggest riser this week was Vronos, Masked Inquisitor (Commander Masters), up 407 percent to $22.30. The steepest fall was Valkyrie Harbinger (Kaldheim), down 53 percent to $3.77. Reality Fracture, the newest set, moved up 5.3 percent as a whole. A price is a listing price, not an offer, and a week is a short window: treat a spike as a question, not an answer.</p>\n<p><strong>Biggest risers</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>Vronos, Masked Inquisitor</strong> (Commander Masters): $4.40 to $22.30, +407%</li><li><strong>Magister Sphinx</strong> (Double Masters 2022): $1.60 to $5.27, +230%</li><li><strong>Chandra, Legacy of Fire</strong> (Commander Masters): $5.70 to $16.12, +183%</li><li><strong>Jace, Arcane Strategist</strong> (Jumpstart 2022): $2.18 to $4.69, +116%</li><li><strong>Kellan, the Kid</strong> (Outlaws of Thunder Junction): $2.12 to $4.09, +93%</li><li><strong>Herald&#x27;s Horn</strong> (Foundations Commander): $2.47 to $4.60, +86%</li><li><strong>Phyrexian Arena</strong> (Foundations Commander): $1.36 to $2.38, +76%</li><li><strong>Vraska, Betrayal&#x27;s Sting</strong> (Lorwyn Eclipsed Commander): $2.04 to $3.50, +71%</li><li><strong>Avengers Assemble!</strong> (Marvel Super Heroes): $1.64 to $2.75, +68%</li><li><strong>Sandstone Needle</strong> (Mercadian Masques): $6.27 to $10.40, +66%</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Biggest fallers</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>Valkyrie Harbinger</strong> (Kaldheim): $7.97 to $3.77, -53%</li><li><strong>Turbulent Shore</strong> (Reality Fracture Commander): $3.87 to $2.51, -35%</li><li><strong>M.O.D.O.K., Evil Intellect</strong> (Marvel Super Heroes Commander): $3.77 to $2.46, -35%</li><li><strong>Boromir, Warden of the Tower</strong> (The Lord of the Rings: Tales of Middle-earth): $5.58 to $3.72, -33%</li><li><strong>Sythis, Harvest&#x27;s Hand</strong> (Modern Horizons 2): $3.57 to $2.40, -33%</li><li><strong>Captain America, Super-Soldier</strong> (Marvel Super Heroes): $3.25 to $2.19, -33%</li><li><strong>The Indomitable</strong> (The Lost Caverns of Ixalan Commander): $4.76 to $3.24, -32%</li><li><strong>The Echoverse Fulcrum</strong> (Reality Fracture): $4.40 to $3.00, -32%</li><li><strong>Voltaic Key</strong> (Magic 2011): $5.11 to $3.54, -31%</li><li><strong>Graveborn Muse</strong> (Foundations Commander): $3.98 to $2.76, -30%</li></ul>\n<p><strong>New set spotlight: Reality Fracture</strong></p>\n<ul><li>The Theorist, Jace Beleren: $81.27, +94% this week</li><li>Hexhaven Invigorator: $32.00, -10% this week</li><li>Emrakul, the Exigent Doom: $23.33, -7% this week</li></ul>\n<p>Every card in the set, priced daily: <a href=\"https://secondmainphasetrading.com/sets/fra/\">https://secondmainphasetrading.com/sets/fra/</a></p>\n<p>Cards that moved at least $1, priced at $2 or more, from 2026-10-07 to 2026-10-14. The full archive: <a href=\"https://secondmainphasetrading.com/movers/\">https://secondmainphasetrading.com/movers/</a></p>",
